            {
              "text": "The animal felt much better immediately.",
              "audioStart": 145.537,
              "audioEnd": 147.7
            },
            {
              "text": "It gave a happy little sound.",
              "audioStart": 148.562,
              "audioEnd": 150.088
            },
            {
              "text": "From that day, the creature remembered the good act and stayed with his new human friend.",
              "audioStart": 150.95,
              "audioEnd": 155.325
            },
            {
              "text": "The animal hunted food every day.",
              "audioStart": 156.188,
              "audioEnd": 158.188
            },
            {
              "text": "It brought meat for Androcles to eat.",
              "audioStart": 159.05,
              "audioEnd": 160.963
            },
            {
              "text": "They lived together in quiet for several months.",
              "audioStart": 161.825,
              "audioEnd": 164.3
            },
            {
              "text": "They shared a quiet life in the deep forest.",
              "audioStart": 165.162,
              "audioEnd": 167.412
            },
            {
              "text": "They spent many hours together under the green trees.",
              "audioStart": 168.275,
              "audioEnd": 171.15
            },
            {
              "text": "The giant protected Androcles from other wild creatures.",
              "audioStart": 172.012,
              "audioEnd": 175.025
            },
            {
              "text": "Androcles shared his food and water with the giant.",
              "audioStart": 175.887,
              "audioEnd": 178.4
            },
            {
              "text": "They became very close friends over time.",
              "audioStart": 179.262,
              "audioEnd": 181.5
            },
            {
              "text": "The man taught the animal many things about living in the woods.",
              "audioStart": 182.363,
              "audioEnd": 185.475
            },
            {
              "text": "The animal learned how to find the best water.",
              "audioStart": 186.338,
              "audioEnd": 188.5
            },
            {
              "text": "They walked together every morning.",
              "audioStart": 189.363,
              "audioEnd": 191.15
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun shone brightly through the branches.",
              "audioStart": 192.012,
              "audioEnd": 194.15
            },
            {
              "text": "Life in the forest was simple and good.",
              "audioStart": 195.012,
              "audioEnd": 197.025
            },
            {
              "text": "They had no worries during those months.",
              "audioStart": 197.887,
              "audioEnd": 199.775
            },
            {
              "text": "The animal was always happy to see Androcles.",
              "audioStart": 200.637,
              "audioEnd": 203.137
            },
            {
              "text": "Androcles loved his animal friend dearly.",
              "audioStart": 204,
              "audioEnd": 206.287
            },
            {
              "text": "They trusted each other without any doubt.",
              "audioStart": 207.15,
              "audioEnd": 209.188
            },
            {
              "text": "The forest felt like a real home to them.",
              "audioStart": 210.05,
              "audioEnd": 212.2
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing could disturb their quiet days.",
              "audioStart": 213.062,
              "audioEnd": 215.05
            },
            {
              "text": "They were safe among the tall trees.",
              "audioStart": 215.912,
              "audioEnd": 217.775
            },
            {
              "text": "However, some soldiers eventually found Androcles.",
              "audioStart": 218.637,
              "audioEnd": 221.637
            },
            {
              "text": "They took him back to the city as a prisoner.",
              "audioStart": 222.5,
              "audioEnd": 224.588
            },
            {
              "text": "The journey back to the city was long and hard.",
              "audioStart": 225.45,
              "audioEnd": 227.688
            },
            {
              "text": "Androcles felt very sad about leaving the forest.",
              "audioStart": 228.55,
              "audioEnd": 231.262
            },
            {
              "text": "He missed his animal friend every single moment.",
              "audioStart": 232.125,
              "audioEnd": 234.688
            },
            {
              "text": "The soldiers brought him to a dark room.",
              "audioStart": 235.55,
              "audioEnd": 237.488
            },
            {
              "text": "He had to stay there until the final day.",
              "audioStart": 238.35,
              "audioEnd": 240.35
            },
            {
              "text": "In those days, men who ran away were often brought to a public place.",
              "audioStart": 241.213,
              "audioEnd": 245.137
            },
            {
              "text": "They were treated very badly there.",
              "audioStart": 246,
              "audioEnd": 247.7
            },
            {
              "text": "They put Androcles into a large open area.",
              "audioStart": 248.562,
              "audioEnd": 250.887
            },
            {
              "text": "There was a wild animal with him.",
              "audioStart": 251.75,
              "audioEnd": 253.425
            },
            {
              "text": "This animal had not eaten for days.",
              "audioStart": 254.287,
              "audioEnd": 256.212
            },
            {
              "text": "The crowd watched from their seats.",
              "audioStart": 257.075,
              "audioEnd": 258.825
            },
            {
              "text": "They expected the poor man to die very quickly.",
              "audioStart": 259.688,
              "audioEnd": 262.25
            },
            {
              "text": "The dangerous animal ran out toward the prisoner with a loud, frightening sound.",
              "audioStart": 263.113,
              "audioEnd": 267.1
            },
            {
              "text": "When the animal came close, it suddenly stopped.",
              "audioStart": 267.962,
              "audioEnd": 270.637
            },
            {
              "text": "It recognized the man.",
              "audioStart": 271.5,
              "audioEnd": 272.775
            },
            {
              "text": "Instead of attacking him, the animal began to touch Androcles with its head.",
              "audioStart": 273.637,
              "audioEnd": 277.613
            },
            {
              "text": "It was like a friendly dog.",
              "audioStart": 278.475,
              "audioEnd": 279.938
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone in the audience was very surprised to see such a strange sight.",
              "audioStart": 280.8,
              "audioEnd": 284.45
            },
            {
              "text": "The people in the crowd whispered to each other.",
              "audioStart": 285.312,
              "audioEnd": 288.755
            },
            {
              "text": "They could not believe what they were seeing.",
              "audioStart": 289.617,
              "audioEnd": 291.417
            },
            {
              "text": "The ruler of the city stood up from his seat.",
              "audioStart": 292.279,
              "audioEnd": 294.417
            },
            {
              "text": "He watched the strange event with great interest.",
              "audioStart": 295.279,
              "audioEnd": 297.68
            },
            {
              "text": "He wanted to know how this was possible.",
              "audioStart": 298.542,
              "audioEnd": 300.517
            },
            {
              "text": "The ruler of the city heard about this wonderful event.",
              "audioStart": 301.38,
              "audioEnd": 303.942
            },
            {
              "text": "He called the prisoner to him.",
              "audioStart": 304.805,
              "audioEnd": 306.229
            },
            {
              "text": "Androcles told the whole story about the point.",
              "audioStart": 307.092,
              "audioEnd": 309.442
            },
            {
              "text": "He explained how they had lived together in the forest.",
              "audioStart": 310.305,
              "audioEnd": 313.005
            },
            {
              "text": "The leader was so happy that he gave the man his freedom.",
              "audioStart": 313.867,
              "audioEnd": 316.579
            },
            {
              "text": "He also let the great creature go back to the wild.",
              "audioStart": 317.442,
              "audioEnd": 320.017
            },
            {
              "text": "Androcles thanked the ruler for his great kindness.",
              "audioStart": 320.88,
              "audioEnd": 323.542
            },
            {
              "text": "The crowd shouted for the man and the giant.",
              "audioStart": 324.404,
              "audioEnd": 326.579
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone was happy that the story ended well.",
              "audioStart": 327.442,
              "audioEnd": 329.692
            },
            {
              "text": "Androcles walked out of the city as a free person.",
              "audioStart": 330.555,
              "audioEnd": 333.204
            },
            {
              "text": "The giant animal returned to the green forest.",
              "audioStart": 334.067,
              "audioEnd": 336.454
            },
            {
              "text": "They never forgot the time they spent together.",
              "audioStart": 337.317,
              "audioEnd": 339.579
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
